**Automated backups** — RDS-managed daily volume snapshots plus continuous transaction logs, enabling **point-in-time recovery** to any second within the retention window. Retention is configurable **0–35 days** (0 disables them; default **7 days** via console, **1 day** via CLI/API). Deleted when the retention period expires or the DB instance is deleted (unless retained).

**Manual snapshots** — user-initiated full backups taken on demand. **No point-in-time recovery** (restore to the snapshot moment only). **Persist until you explicitly delete them** — not removed with the DB instance — ideal for long-term archival/compliance.","children":[]}]}]}]}}
